   "text": "StyleKart, an online fashion retailer, recently offered customers 90-day credit (earlier 15 days) to boost sales. It also stocks large inventories six months ahead of each season. Suppliers have reduced their credit from 60 days to 15 days. Despite record sales, StyleKart is struggling to pay salaries. Current assets are ₹80 lakh (inventory ₹55 lakh), current liabilities ₹40 lakh.",
